flowchart TD
  A[Student clicks Submit] --> B[Create Submission]
  B --> C[Set status submitted, grade null, feedback null]
  C --> D[Student sees Grade pending, Feedback none]
  D --> E[Teacher reviews]
  E --> F{On time}
  F -- No --> G[Set status late]
  F -- Yes --> H[Keep status submitted]
  E --> I[Teacher sets grade and feedback]
  I --> J[Update status graded]
  J --> K[Student sees Grade number, Feedback text]